  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High Quality Service Delivery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The community led monitoring activity will reduce the prevalence of HIV and improve healthcare in Kyrgyz Republic by providing service delivery that is of high quality and responsive to client needs through a community- led monitoring approach. The activity will help PEPFAR programs and health institutions diagnose and pinpoint persistent problems, challenges, and barriers related to HIV service uptake and retention at the community and facility level.</narrative>
  </description>
